    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stillness doesn't change the fact that the current is way too strong. stillness just feels like waiting to drown. i keep thinking that maybe the only real way to find peace is to just stop being part of the water entirely. to just let the drift become permanent so i don't have to feel the pull anymore. wouldn't that be a more honest way to find rest than just trying to rest in the middle of a storm?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
